al break over the late-semester meal.","short_summary":"Faculty and professional staff serve pancakes and other breakfast food as students pause during finals week.","evidence_claim":"F&M documents FlapJack Fest as a finals-week study break with free pancakes, eggs, tots, and more, served by faculty and professional staff in the Dining Hall.","source_url":"https://www.fandm.edu/traditions/","source_title":"F&M Campus Traditions","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A finals-week campus meal; verify the current date, serving period, location, and student-access requirements.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fm-spring-arts","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Spring Arts","title":"Step Away at Spring Arts","subtitle":"F&M’s spring-semester break for food and music","notes":"Follow campus event announcements for the date and location, then set aside classwork long enough to hear the music and join the activities.","short_summary":"Students gather during the spring semester for an organized break featuring food, music, and recreation.","evidence_claim":"F&M identifies Spring Arts as a spring-semester event where students can step away from classwork, have fun, eat food, and listen to music.","source_url":"https://www.fandm.edu/traditions/","source_title":"F&M Campus Traditions","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Campus event details may change annually; confirm the current schedule, location, and participation rules.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fm-lux-et-lex-walk","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Lux et Lex Walk","title":"Bookend College Under Lux et Lex","subtitle":"Students reverse direction beneath F&M’s Light and Law arch","notes":"Notice which way the class passes beneath the Klauder-Apple Walkway arch: arrival and graduation send students in opposite directions.","short_summary":"The same inscribed arch marks both a student’s entrance to F&M and the closing passage before Commencement.","evidence_claim":"F&M states that new students walk beneath the Lux et Lex arch to begin their College journey and pass under it in the opposite direction four years later before Commencement.","source_url":"https://www.fandm.edu/traditions/","source_title":"F&M Campus Traditions","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The ceremonial walks are tied to new-student arrival and pre-Commencement programming; consult the applicable schedule.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fm-senior-bonfire","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Senior Bonfire","title":"Gather at the Senior Bonfire","subtitle":"A class-only farewell hosted by the Senior Class Cabinet","notes":"Eligible seniors should follow cabinet announcements, dress for an outdoor evening, and use the gathering to reconnect before Commencement.","short_summary":"The graduating class closes its campus chapter together with a bonfire, games, music, s’mores, and a farewell gift.","evidence_claim":"F&M documents the Senior Bonfire as an annual event open to the senior class and hosted by the Senior Class Cabinet, with s’mores, music, games, and a farewell gift.","source_url":"https://www.fandm.edu/traditions/","source_title":"F&M Campus Traditions","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Restricted to the senior class; follow official instructions concerning the date, location, weather, and fire-safety controls.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fm-college-mace","