:"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Observed as part of Commencement protocol; ceremony admission and viewing arrangements are published separately each year.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fm-williamson-medal","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Williamson Medal","title":"Recognize the Williamson Medalist","subtitle":"F&M’s annual Commencement honor for character, leadership, and scholarship","notes":"Read the annual recipient’s citation before Commencement, then listen for the medal presentation among the College’s formal recognitions.","short_summary":"Since 1922, F&M has singled out one graduating senior through its highest student award.","evidence_claim":"F&M states that the Williamson Medal is presented annually at Commencement to the graduating-class member with the highest standing in character, leadership, and scholarship, a practice continuing since 1922.","source_url":"https://www.fandm.edu/academic-associations-and-honor-societies/","source_title":"Academic Associations and Honor Societies","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The recipient is recognized through annual Commencement programming; consult the current ceremony information for access details.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
